t("Chronomancer", "Chronomancer", "birth descriptor name")
t("Some do not walk upon the straight road others follow. Seek the hidden paths outside the normal course of life.", "Some do not walk upon the straight road others follow. Seek the hidden paths outside the normal course of life.", "_t")
t("Exploiting a hole in the fabric of spacetime, Chronomancers learn to pull threads from other timelines into their own.", "Exploiting a hole in the fabric of spacetime, Chronomancers learn to pull threads from other timelines into their own.", "_t")
t("Pulling these threads creates tension and the harder they pull the more tension is produced.", "Pulling these threads creates tension and the harder they pull the more tension is produced.", "_t")
t("Constantly they manage this tension, which they call Paradox, to avoid or control the anomalies they inevitably unleash on the world around them.", "Constantly they manage this tension, which they call Paradox, to avoid or control the anomalies they inevitably unleash on the world around them.", "_t")
t("Paradox Mage", "Paradox Mage", "birth descriptor name")
t("A hand may clap alone if it returns to clap itself. Search for the power in the paradox.", "A hand may clap alone if it returns to clap itself. Search for the power in the paradox.", "_t")
t("A Paradox Mage studies the very fabric of spacetime, learning not just to bend it but shape it and remake it.", "A Paradox Mage studies the very fabric of spacetime, learning not just to bend it but shape it and remake it.", "_t")
t("Most Paradox Mages lack basic skills that others take for granted (like general fighting sense), but they make up for it through control of cosmic forces.", "Most Paradox Mages lack basic skills that others take for granted (like general fighting sense), but they make up for it through control of cosmic forces.", "_t")
t("Paradox Mages start off with knowledge of all but the most complex Chronomantic schools.", "Paradox Mages start off with knowledge of all but the most complex Chronomantic schools.", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Magic and Willpower", "Their most important stats are: Magic and Willpower", "_t")
