t("Temporal Warden", "Temporal Warden", "birth descriptor name")
t("We preserve the past to protect the future. The hands of time are guarded by the arms of war.", "We preserve the past to protect the future. The hands of time are guarded by the arms of war.", "_t")
t("Their lifelines braided, Temporal Wardens have learned to work with their other selves across multiple timelines.", "Their lifelines braided, Temporal Wardens have learned to work with their other selves across multiple timelines.", "_t")
t("Through their study of chronomancy, they learn to blend archery and dual-weapon fighting, seamlessly switching from one to the other.", "Through their study of chronomancy, they learn to blend archery and dual-weapon fighting, seamlessly switching from one to the other.", "_t")
